INSERT INTO `blog` (`id`, `title`, `category`, `subcategory`, `date`, `description`, `views`, `image_path`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(3, 'EFL Annual Meeting 2023: A Perfect Blend of Work, Play, and Relaxation', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>The EFL Annual Meeting 2023:</strong></p>\r\n<p><br />The meeting was nothing short of spectacular, set against the breathtaking backdrop of Cox\'s Bazar, the world&rsquo;s longest sea beach. The event brought together team members from across the organization for a weekend filled with engaging discussions, exciting activities, and unforgettable memories.</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.879%; height: 587.812px;\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 587.812px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.9524%; height: 587.812px;\"><img title=\"Mask group (1).png\" src=\"blob:http://localhost/2bbc4209-9a77-486f-bbf8-503614f8436e\" alt=\"\" width=\"226\" height=\"170\" /></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.0831%; height: 587.812px;\"><strong>Insightful Discussions and Team Spirit</strong><br />The event began with focused sessions highlighting achievements, challenges, and strategies for the future. The serene beachside venue encouraged open dialogue and innovative thinking.<br />After the discussions, a friendly football match on the golden sands of Cox&rsquo;s Bazar showcased teamwork and determination, energizing everyone with cheers and camaraderie.<br /><br /><strong>Relaxation and Culinary Delights</strong><br />The sparkling swimming pool offered a refreshing retreat where colleagues bonded over shared laughter and relaxation. The culinary experience was a highlight, featuring local seafood and international cuisines served under the stars, making every moment memorable.<br /><br /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 102.283%; height: 178.594px;\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 178.594px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50.4786%; height: 178.594px;\"><img title=\"Mask group (2).png\" src=\"blob:http://localhost/2c595b7a-67dc-4e44-94ca-5c0c67e5f709\" alt=\"\" width=\"220\" height=\"171\" /></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.6157%; height: 178.594px;\"><img title=\"Mask group (3).png\" src=\"blob:http://localhost/664ebbfd-f2c0-4cf3-a8d9-a78ad690c9fa\" alt=\"\" width=\"216\" height=\"168\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>The EFL Annual Meetings 2023 perfectly captured the essence of teamwork, innovation, and relaxation. Beyond just a corporate gathering, it was a celebration of the organization&rsquo;s achievements and a testament to the collective spirit of the team. The tranquil setting of Cox&rsquo;s Bazar allowed participants to reconnect with nature, rejuvenate, and build stronger bonds with their colleagues.<br />The event&rsquo;s blend of insightful discussions, recreational activities, and shared experiences left everyone inspired and motivated to tackle future challenges. As the team returned to their daily routines, they carried with them not just memories of a picturesque retreat but also a renewed commitment to excellence and collaboration. Here&rsquo;s to many more successful gatherings that strengthen our team and fuel our journey forward!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 31, 'public/uploads/blog_images/1736929569_image 5.png', '2025-01-15 08:26:09', '2025-02-05 04:03:24'),
(4, 'Annual Meeting 2023: A Perfect Blend of Work, Play, and Relaxation	 The EFL Annual Meeting 2024', NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '<p>The meeting was nothing short of spectacular, set against the breathtaking backdrop of Cox\'s Bazar, the world&rsquo;s longest sea beach. The event brought together team members from across the organization for a weekend filled with engaging discussions, exciting activities, and unforgettable memories.</p>', 35, 'public/uploads/blog_images/1736933351_Mask group (3).png', '2025-01-15 09:29:11', '2025-02-05 10:12:54'),
(5, 'Annual Meeting 2023: A Perfect Blend of Work, Play, and Relaxation The EFL Annual Meeting 2024', NULL, NULL, '2025-01-02', '<p>Annual Meeting 2023: A Perfect Blend of Work, Play, and Relaxation The EFL Annual Meeting 2024Annual Meeting 2023: A Perfect Blend of Work, Play, and Relaxation The EFL Annual Meeting 2024Annual Meeting 2023: A Perfect Blend of Work, Play, and Relaxation The EFL Annual Meeting 2024Annual Meeting 2023: A Perfect Blend of Work, Play, and Relaxation The EFL Annual Meeting 2024</p>', 30, 'public/uploads/blog_images/1737004242_image 5 (1).png', '2025-01-16 05:10:42', '2025-02-05 13:35:49');
